---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Pricing & Value Math | Single $39/mo All-In Plan" description="Transparent pricing for independent pack & ship stores. $39/month flat. No onboarding fees, no contracts, no hardware costs. Cancel anytime.">
  <section class="pt-20 pb-16 bg-gradient-to-b from-navy/50 via-black to-black border-b border-border-subtle">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-navy border border-border-subtle text-xs font-semibold text-gold mb-6">
        No Tier Games • No Setup Fees • No Contracts
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6">
        One plan. Everything included. $39 a month.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Legacy software companies hit you with 6-month paper leases, auto-renewals, and hidden tech fees. We give you a complete counter operating system for less than the revenue of two mailbox rentals.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRICING CARD & BREAKDOWN -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-black border-b border-border-subtle">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl bg-navy/30 border border-gold/40 shadow-2xl relative">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-8 pb-10 border-b border-border-subtle">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold mb-2 block">The Store Operator Plan</span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Full Counter Intake & Release</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 mt-2">Everything your front desk needs to process mail and packages smoothly.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-left md:text-right">
            <div class="flex items-baseline md:justify-end gap-1">
              <span class="text-5xl font-black text-white">$39</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm font-medium">/ month</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 block mt-1">Billed monthly • Cancel anytime</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Included Checklist -->
        <div class="py-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-y-4 gap-x-8 text-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-200">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span><strong>Camera label intake:</strong> Any tablet or phone</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-200">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span><strong>Automatic SMS & Email alerts</strong> included</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-200">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span><strong>Digital signature capture</strong> with audit history</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-200">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span><strong>Assisted roster migration</strong> from CashMate/PostalMate</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-200">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span><strong>Zero-install cloud app:</strong> Always updated</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-200">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span><strong>Continuous cloud backup:</strong> Encrypted data</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-200">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span><strong>Multiple addressees:</strong> Spouses & business DBAs</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-200">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            <span><strong>No hardware fees:</strong> No proprietary scanners</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-8 border-t border-border-subtle flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">
            Ready to get started? Book your assisted setup call. We format and import your customer list with you.
          </div>
          <a 
            href="https://cal.com" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-base font-bold bg-gold text-black hover:bg-gold-hover transition-colors shadow-md flex-shrink-0"
          >
            Book Free Onboarding Call
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HORMOZI VALUE MATH (WHY $39 MAKES SENSE) -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-black">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-gold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Return on Investment</h2>
        <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">The math behind the $39 price tag.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-navy/30 border border-border-subtle">
          <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gold mb-2">30 Mins / Day</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Labor Recovered</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Eliminating manual typing, deciphering messy carrier handwriting, and answering phone status calls saves over 15 hours of counter staff time every single month.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-navy/30 border border-border-subtle">
          <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gold mb-2">$0 Equipment</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Zero Capital Expense</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            No $400 sheet-fed scanners or dedicated barcode equipment to purchase. Open the web app on any smartphone or tablet already sitting behind your register.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-navy/30 border border-border-subtle">
          <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gold mb-2">Zero Lock-In</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Freedom From Leases</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Legacy software locks you into 6-month paper leases with 30-day cancellation windows. With MyMailhub, you pay monthly. If you aren't thrilled, cancel with one click.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
